## 18. Preliminary Thermal V1 Scope
The defensible V1 scope for the ECUlytics Thermal Management Platform is a **Cloud-Based Advisory Dashboard** that ingests validated CAN telemetry, derives physical/temporal features, and passes them through a Hybrid CNN-LSTM to output a complete thermal map. The system will primarily focus on calculating the basic Thermal State (Tmax, $\Delta$T), isolating Hotspots, and detecting Sensor Faults by comparing virtual predictions against physical readings. More speculative predictive features (Time-to-Limit, Thermal Aging Index, and Cooling Diagnostics) should be deferred to a V1.5 release to ensure the core virtual sensor is robust, accurate, and safely bounded.
